"It is a thorny path, but the attitude of walking it regardless is not bad. In this era, where the Witch Cult has vanished in exchange for the kingdom's destruction, and fear of the 'Witch of Envy' has mostly become a formality, the only thing that still cloaks the title of 'Witch' in dread is the existence of the 'Witch of Melancholy'... if that were gone, it would be meaningful for me as well."

"――――"

"Hmm, why have you fallen silent? Disrespectful, you know, disrespectful."

